subject: fix(reliability): add AbortSignal.timeout(8000) to all 22 unprotected fetch calls in provider validation (GAP-P1-25)

The validateProvider function makes 27 sequential fetch calls to different
provider APIs. Only 5 had AbortSignal.timeout(8000). This adds the same
timeout to the remaining 22, preventing indefinite hangs when a provider
API is unreachable or slow.

Affected providers: openai-compatible, custom-embedding, anthropic-compat,
cloudflare-ai, azure, openai, vercel-ai-gateway, anthropic, gemini,
openrouter, glm/kimi/minimax/alicode (both formats), volcengine-ark,
byteplus, opencode-go, commandcode, deepgram, blackbox, vertex,
vertex-partner, grok-web, perplexity-web.

